{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-24","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If two numbers be prime to any number, their product also will be prime to the same.","book":7,"number":24,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.24","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.24/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":24,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","contentId":"euclid-7-24","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1c4854dbe69671f495b13cf905604a53fe2f414436178aa13c8cbfa9df8b7d6","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-24.statement","euclid-7-24.construction.1","euclid-7-24.proof.1","euclid-7-24.construction.2","euclid-7-24.proof.2","euclid-7-24.proof.3","euclid-7-24.proof.4","euclid-7-24.proof.5","euclid-7-24.proof.6","euclid-7-24.proof.7","euclid-7-24.proof.8","euclid-7-24.proof.9","euclid-7-24.conclusion","euclid-7-24.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-24.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9feaf06018455a6e87f676387d51ee06566dc8e134b022e340d12a79f74a7690","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers be prime to any number, their product also will be prime to the same."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字是任何一个数字的起始数,它们的产品也将是同一数字的起始数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f614a5d4aa14e813f3dc74cabb68f0bc6eb3c3eab1fdc887cbc3d668eeb210d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two numbers A, B be prime to any number C, and let A by multiplying B make D; I say that C, D are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B数字是C数字的首选数字,A和B数字是D;我说C,D数字是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"741304e1961ce15b7bc0a788de620d247eae62bf56df71a731d8d34d42a252d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if C, D are not prime to one another, some number will measure C, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果C,D不是互素, 某些数字是整除,C,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b30fee99773b867161b6950d0607cfb3089b27cc0bfec247e6876c7ab9e9cf8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a number measure them, and let it be E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们数到整除,然后E"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4398ff8dca58ac1aa975a6ab226ddd783a9ac431e94966194af93334432ca9d","citations":["euclid-7-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since C, A are prime to one another, and a certain number E measures C, therefore A, E are prime to one another. [[VII. 23](/principles/euclid-7-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,C,A是互素, 和一定的E,整除,C, 所以A,E是互素。 [[VII. 23](/principles/euclid-7-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"892ee8a91bea5567a0791ca86e70a5eba5002c0a735a4f8a17bb69bb5144071c","citations":["euclid-7-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"As many times, then, as E measures D, so many units let there be in F; therefore F also measures D according to the units in E. [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"F,有E 整除 D次,单位次;因此,根据E的单位次,F次也是整除 D次。 [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c282da463971c88c9db8d3deab44585905921bd461f3f1e5879906402d80f14","citations":["euclid-7-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore E by multiplying F has made D. [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E乘以F, 已经产生了D。 [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6263d916cf3f909b2b79b4ecaaa3dc78f078b243b58076345760809a68abd761","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, further, A by multiplying B has also made D; therefore the product of E, F is equal to the product of A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,再者,A乘以B也达到D;因此,E,F的产值等于A,B的产值。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f12bdae4654840a60dddc13420d1a38486c143a621077190986054d67952ad1","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if the product of the extremes be equal to that of the means, the four numbers are proportional; [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)] therefore, as E is to A, so is B to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果极端的产物与经济来源的产物相等,则4个数字为成比例;因此,E对A的比等于B对F的比；E 与 A 之比等于 B 与 F 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94b5c521ccf5ac0dec448e3a00fd9bea42b7daa5f8a0191e1695fbb1e6c015c6","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A, E are prime to one another, numbers which are prime to one another are also the least of those which have the same ratio, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least numbers of those which have the same ratio with them measure those which have the same ratio the same number of times, the greater the greater and the less the less, that is, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent; [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] therefore E measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A,E是互素, 这个数字也是同样比中最少的,互素是相同比中最少的,整除是相同比中最少的,整除是相同比的,数量较大,数量较小,数量较小,即前身和相应后果的前身;因此,E,整除,B。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1e6b27b44fdeab7cd8c7aa1d1a4753101ca2dbf0f62c99f8d7916f8bb31e8ad","citations":["euclid-7-def-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures C; therefore E measures B, C which are prime to one another: which is impossible. [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也整除 C; 因此,E 整除 B,C, 也就是互素: 这是不可能的。 [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d6ce85eec3d82c35605356c16042dcb73471d71f7d6ac24c0e0df2de4411ba81","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no number will measure the numbers C, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,没有号码整除 C,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"743b271a3402aad37ba97c8a41ab76133516a80aa63940ef9426ca67a9136dc7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C, D are prime to one another. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C,D是互素。 Q. E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-24.source","contentId":"euclid-7-24","revisionId":"euclid-7-24@raw-d1c4854dbe69671f","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"357e10af85c1e52ad778676438a329ff384d770a2ccdeceb1852a71dc31f9ae0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.24/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.24\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-24:euclid-7-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-24.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.24","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.24/","sourceLabel":"VII. 23"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-24:euclid-7-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-24.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.24","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.24/","sourceLabel":"VII. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-24:euclid-7-def-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-24.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","